	(text "BUCK C — +5V_USB (TPS54560, 5 A) and the quiet +3V3 rail (TLV62569 from +5V_USB)\nGolden reference: datasheets/reference/ti-slvu863-tps54560-evm.pdf, datasheets/tps54560.pdf, datasheets/tlv62569.pdf\nParts (LCSC): TPS54560DDAR C31966, TLV62569DBVR C141836\nConsumes: +19V_IN, GND.  Produces: +5V_USB (3 × 1.5 A ports + 3V3), +3V3 (hub I/O, HD3SS3220, CH344Q, front-ends, < 0.5 A)\nName the switch node SW and the bootstrap node BOOT on both converters (SW_NODE net class by pattern).\nBring-up: test points + power-good LEDs on +5V_USB and +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
